#!/bin/sh
# probes/rubi/05-section9-utility-closure.run -- the transitive utility
# closure of the section-9 port (9.2 + 9.3). Static over the pinned Rubi
# clone and the working tree's translation table and utils, seconds.
#
#   sh probes/rubi/05-section9-utility-closure.run
cd "$(dirname "$0")/../.." || exit 1
python3 probes/rubi/05-section9-utility-closure.py \
    > probes/rubi/05-section9-utility-closure.out
echo "wrote probes/rubi/05-section9-utility-closure.out"
